        <skos:definition xml:lang="en" xmlns:xml="http://www.w3.org/XML/1998/namespace">1) The plants of an area considered in general or as communities, but not taxonomically; the total plant cover in a particular area or on the Earth as a whole. 2) The total mass of plant life that occupies a given area.</skos:definition>
