        <skos:definition xml:lang="en" xmlns:xml="http://www.w3.org/XML/1998/namespace">The Indian Remote Sensing Satellite IRS-1D was successfully launched into polar orbit on 29 September 1997 by a PSLV launch vehicle. Its sensors were activated in the middle of October 1997.</skos:definition>
