        <skos:definition xml:lang="en" xmlns:xml="http://www.w3.org/XML/1998/namespace">SENSE is a receiver for AIS (Automatic Identification System) signal reception from ships at sea, providing worldwide tracking (identification, position, course and speed information) plus detailed vessel characteristics for maritime safety.</skos:definition>
