        <skos:definition xml:lang="en" xmlns:xml="http://www.w3.org/XML/1998/namespace">The European Remote Sensing Satellites (ERS-1 and ERS-2) are equippedwith a Laser Retroreflector (LRR), a passive optical instrumentoperating in the infra-red, to permit ranging of the satellite by theuse of Laser Tracking Stations, and therefore the accuratedetermination of its height.</skos:definition>
